WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Read two separate checks
My store → Documents shows verification and expiry separately. Filter
this vendor’s expired, next-30-day or undated records. No expiry
recorded is not a permanent-validity promise.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Use the printed date
Select the document type and printed expiry with the calendar. Leave an
unknown date blank. Vendor uploads start Pending review. This form was
demonstrated without sending a file.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Expired evidence cannot be approved
Vendors → selected vendor → Compliance → Documents shows this vendor’s
expiry risks. Approve is disabled here, and the backend also rejects
expired approval through either write path.

4
00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:32.000
Make review explicit
The edit form does not silently reuse an old approval. File, type or
expiry changes return evidence to Pending unless an authorized reviewer
explicitly selects a reviewed status. Vendor identity cannot be
reassigned.
